This repository documents the Carrier Vetting Tool in Gmail (Highway.com and Carrier411)
(Chrome Web Store item hpejmgmlnjcfjccehkdgnjgdafmfjjao) and related materials.
The matching userscript is GmailHighwayCarrier411MCBadges.user.js in the
PjSkip/TamperMonkeyScripts repository.

